        {
          "alias": "headerText",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "At Vepo Envirotrax\u00AE, we take pride in delivering an online system that improves efficiency across the board.                       From water systems optimizing their compliance processes to in the field professionals simplifying report entry, our platform helps streamline operations for everyone involved.                       But don\u2019t just take our word for it, see what our users have to say about their experience with Envirotrax\u00AE."
        }
